{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "93bd996f78053c173b52c4b2521f39b41d7cc811ad219448c828bab590cf49e6", "ja": "青羽さん。お疲れさまです！\nなんだか気合いが入っている感じですね？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了！\n感觉你干劲十足呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "fa7c41f46154fe3c31c4b028bba745d7680c60b393f5491adb583399b31935b0", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\n今、夏休みのことを考えていて……あっ、そうだ！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n我刚才正在想暑假的事……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "5348fd3a22f5166c404eccb8cb77368d158e5d3cff353e9e0079f5231daacc44", "ja": "{$P$}さんのお顔を見て、\n思い出しました！　社長さんがお呼びでしたよ♪", "zh": "看到{$P$}先生的脸，\n我想起来了！社长在找您哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2ca5238cf265a27e7597fe6038c2ad02f0a40a1844a81bfd2a5bcd68807bd163", "ja": "社長が？　何か仕事の話かな。\nありがとうございます、それじゃすぐに……。", "zh": "社长找我？是有什么工作上的事吗。\n谢谢您告诉我，那我马上……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "35f76af755e98bf7f1cdfb309be15aa44477644cdd44defb1a0a3bb99602294f", "ja": "え～っ！？　そんなのつまんないぞーっ！！", "zh": "诶～！？那样也太没意思了吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "d95fcf4a515a57f4150f0f31c8ac0b80f4698a414580a10f1b7f866ad19a2e43", "ja": "あれ？　今のは……環ちゃんの声でしたよね。\nどうかしたんでしょうか？", "zh": "咦？刚才那是……环的声音吧。\n不知道是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "09d2bce2652a26543c6efac119158c29c4473ee0393a3d9159de7c0a8cafba81", "ja": "なんだろう……？\n事務所に行くついでに、ちょっと見てきますよ。", "zh": "不知道是怎么了……？\n我去事务所的时候顺便过去看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "0a91f2800e32e7ebf4469d77c77bc8bdf20601104dee3fb6e91c763730411926", "ja": "それなら安心ですね！　よろしくお願いします。\n行ってらっしゃ～い♪", "zh": "那就放心了！拜托您了。\n路上小心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "3736ae55b4819b974d33a0afb2e7e1f8d6437868dde131d8bfb5799a6cc2eddd", "ja": "やすみなのに家でじっとしてるなんて、おもしろく\nないよー。まつりは、外で虫取りやらないの？", "zh": "明明放假却一直待在家里，太无聊\n了啦——茉莉不去外面抓虫子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "ecc5bee987734c32d7f3c28193857fe5fc01732b7e1cf9fbce4e18ffcfe55375", "ja": "ふふ、お部屋の中で冷たいスイーツと漫画を楽しむのも\nわんだほー！な夏の過ごし方なのですよ♪", "zh": "呵呵，在房间里享受冰凉的甜点和漫画，\n也是超棒的夏日过法哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "8b3ed412e144d6b7ca20dbda74aa3e822a49ae477a62ad499653f90b99d26233", "ja": "紬ちゃんだって、きっとそう思っているのです。\nね、紬ちゃん。……ね？", "zh": "紬也一定是这么想的。\n对吧，小紬……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9ceb79102893354e43b0f3eba28c9bb770e1f515013b3b63c5b1a99c7b7aa007", "ja": "わ、私ですか！？　そうですね……。\nまあ……虫……よりは……。", "zh": "我、我吗！？是啊……  \n不过……比起虫子……要好一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c5d0d6e172e1427198ac28c327c0698268d5e39e9355c3e7736e3bd7f0ad22bf", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\nなんか白熱してるみたいだけど、なんの話？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n好像聊得很热烈啊，你们在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "b0ed0acb8c4ba8e562268bf2e9024494fa393840ead3a01b1914dff92a14057c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nお疲れさまっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "83e65f80cb826ee403e25ad48ee4228f8e1952e8bc6fa2c2294d6e58e8892017", "ja": "お疲れさまです。うふふ♪　環ちゃん達は、\n夏休みの過ごし方について討論してるんですよ。", "zh": "辛苦了。呵呵♪ 环和大家正在讨论暑假要怎么过呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "43e5e52d56a9402e8cba5539283ec596a40eaf80f7f8ed1b8839b148dbbb057e", "ja": "夏休みの過ごし方……？", "zh": "暑假的度过方式……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "4b678767f528726812328b0eff5e92ed164e7134f111aa32b719bf7bd70f5ada", "ja": "環ちゃんは外で遊ぶのが一番だって言うんですけど、\nまつりちゃんは室内で過ごすほうが好きみたいで。", "zh": "小环说最喜欢在外面玩，\n不过小祭好像更喜欢待在室内呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "2dc1f8d82fcf62a74cbd858a9ecfd8c6ef236c573cba8ff551a7d0a8f57413e3", "ja": "アウトドア派vsインドア派ってカンジで、\nどっちも譲らなくてさ。見ごたえのある試合だよ！", "zh": "一个喜欢户外，一个喜欢室内，就这种感觉，双方都不肯让步。真是一场精彩的比赛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "215e7704f36d6db0663f2ae5dd6cb4bb195784ca2afe0b68730318dd246e858c", "ja": "おやぶ～ん！　おやぶんは、外で遊ぶ方が好きだよね！\nかけっことか、川遊びとか！", "zh": "大将——！大将更喜欢在外面玩吧！比如赛跑，或者去河边玩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "6bb3d7f08e31804bca6738730b6c9a905f87a06a7095530a8a321869d9f22396", "ja": "ほ？　お部屋でゲームしたりとかも、\n楽しいのですよ。ね？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "诶？在房间里玩游戏什么的，也很开心哦。对吧，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "56622c8061cda133839380f71ea17d61504b1082e7d219bca8e4e1b433dd8533", "ja": "えっ？　いや、うーん……あっ、そうだ！\n社長に呼ばれてるんだ。行かないと……それじゃ！", "zh": "诶？不，嗯……啊，对了！社长叫我过去呢。不去不行……那就先这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7832cc1c1371fd3b1bc7c5d073be531374ae27d31dd0368783b3d17035280747", "ja": "……ということがあったんですよ。", "zh": "……事情就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "448a0e4771b06a2643039458ce2731e4c3c1ffeb1c7557959af72db8f8380979", "ja": "なるほど、アウトドア派vsインドア派……。\n社長、これは丁度よかったんじゃないですか？", "zh": "原来如此，户外派对室内派……。\n社长，这不是正好合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "802070dcfa80b723cb205efa4b3cc326d5959c1b11ed7f5dee099a2cf4cccf15", "ja": "そうだね音無君！　これは渡りに船というものだ。\nいや～、君！　やはり持っているね。", "zh": "没错，音无君！这可真是雪中送炭啊。\n哎呀～你这家伙！果然是有福气啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "efcf9e63e610b5ce14410ee82121385fccfe22578cb25d127d13cdea9e45cb78", "ja": "ええと……なんの話ですか？", "zh": "呃……您说的是什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "01c29f37fcbbd7c4771aeafeb74783d59617abcc40cea4e9c392bb93e15bfa66", "ja": "実は今度、ディベート形式のイベントを開催しようと\n思っていてね。君を呼んだのも、そのためだったんだ。", "zh": "其实我打算下次办一场辩论形式的活动。\n叫你过来，也是为了这件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "32c4fb61e3cbc9d43e68bcff3a994e8f67c612a9a77c578b98a79e9d4f2c34d2", "ja": "ディベート……討論会、ってことですか。", "zh": "辩论……是指讨论会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "a88441fcc2a87ae37e53deb820342cbf890931524f63e75195f1b2fc54e08957", "ja": "トーク力やプレゼン力も、アイドルの魅力ですからね！\nライブのMC、いつも楽しみにしているんです♪", "zh": "谈话能力和演讲能力，也是偶像的魅力之一呢！\n我一直很期待演唱会的MC环节♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "9c0d0febc41e5e3065520990c406d8b17fde8b6fb7a35fb5b5baa548eb5451ef", "ja": "うむ！　ただ、肝心の議題がまだ決まって\nいなかったんだが……君の話を聞いてピンときたよ。", "zh": "嗯！不过，最重要的议题之前还没定下来……\n听了你的话之后，我突然有了灵感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "7165c866cad3b1655f414876e42a55712982f963b1ffdaf48636947a3b3e04dc", "ja": "アウトドア派vsインドア派！\n果たしてどちらが夏休みを満喫できるのか……。", "zh": "户外派VS室内派！\n究竟哪一派能更充分享受暑假呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "23289b31bfee5d712bbf56bb317aa17ca124f7a31344c0908adb14972cc407f1", "ja": "劇場のアイドル達の全力でもって、\nそれぞれの魅力を語りつくしてもらおうじゃないか！", "zh": "让剧场的偶像们全力以赴，把各自的魅力尽情展现出来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1031_101kot", "source_sha256": "524325301f75bc703ec878cbd0778c5c4e3b2b7e78c5a8eed7454d2d0e694ee1", "ja": "楽しみですね♪　夏休み、私は色々なイベントに……\nあれ？　でもそれってアウトドア？　インドア……？", "zh": "真让人期待呢♪暑假里，我要参加各种各样的活动……\n咦？不过，那算是户外活动？还是室内活动……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0239_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0239_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "8c62ae3d4fccb3733246e1a3009e0ed8f8501e861b396de20c54f9632a4ac7e5", "ja": "（アイドル達の他愛ない話し合いが、イベントになる\nなんてな……よし、早速帰って準備を進めよう！）", "zh": "（偶像们随意的闲聊竟然也能变成活动啊……好，赶紧回去准备吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
